{"title":"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Of the four numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/c/a5c4ed83c01022eb8cda8748ba85ff3679af2e74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^5, 3^4, 4^3, 5^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />, which is the largest number?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/d/2cdd2eb0988320b597445f2fc2abfcebc0d05acc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2^5 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 3^4 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 4^3 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 5^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"306\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859aa1c5d0b45cdfadb7a3cd53a581d893c80542.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{5} = 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/509d1729ec73e12b555f75d4c2e4d6dd738f37e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{4} = 81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/3/013039e44f0037d22097b5f5a118aa0c195b56e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{3} = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1cb2b1216f6a5a6e9672c52b9cbe9349231f450.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{2} = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Of these numbers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/7/cf71ec10f08c47cc9c0c4190b4217881667c6ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 3^4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\" /> is the largest.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Without_Finding_Values.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Without_Finding_Values)\">Solution 2 (Without Finding Values)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Without Finding Values)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, we can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/1/c3117faa7c755c75365975cf75acbdae1b113343.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{3} &gt; 2^{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/b/6bb85b774c690c58b1cb910a8a8295e91e92c1af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{3} = (2^{2})^{3} = 2^{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"122\" height=\"21\" />. This has a higher exponent while the bases are greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Next, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/f/3cfe2aa9033986ae695db2a1eb968d919e840212.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{4} = (3^{2})^{2} = 9^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"122\" height=\"21\" />. This is more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/1/2b1820deed69da37d7cffb93dec8d3ff6c0c95ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{2}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a319c4eabee19fecc32d77bfc464462af4fa3ba3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 &gt; 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> and both bases are greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Finally, we can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/a/7da84048a09d8f106890e599bae46dfa7f4a5640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{3} = 2^{6} = (2^{3})^{2} = 8^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"162\" height=\"21\" />. Using the same logic, we realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/2/ed2cc3bf0644ffdaa41dca29dd0b0c04c234dbf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9^{2} = 3^{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" /> must be larger than this number.\n</p><p>Combining everything, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/7/cf71ec10f08c47cc9c0c4190b4217881667c6ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 3^4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\" /> is the largest number of the four numbers.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC\" title=\"2023 CLMC\">2023 CLMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Answer_Key\" title=\"2023 CLMC Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"20